  "title": "Barramundi with Lemon Basil Sauce",
  "description": "This baked barramundi, or Asian sea bass, features a seasoned bread crumb crust and is topped with a lemon-butter-basil sauce for a flavorful dish.",
  "authors": [
    "spice of life"
  ],
